{"ticker":{"symbol":"TNGX","name":"Tango Therapeutics, Inc.","market":"US","exchange":""},"currency":"USD","price":21.5,"change_pct":0.03018687110685181,"market_cap":3625122816.0,"pe":-12.756238,"pb":3.5332785,"dividend_yield":null,"week52_low":7.49,"week52_high":34.39,"sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Biotechnology","country":"United States","city":"Boston","employees":137,"website":"https://www.tangotx.com","business_summary":"Tango Therapeutics, Inc., a precision oncology company, focuses on the discovery and development of drugs in defined patient populations with unmet medical need. The company develops methylthioadenosine -cooperative protein arginine methyltransferase 5 (PRMT5) inhibitors, including TNG462, which is in Phase 1/2 clinical trial for treating pancreatic and lung cancer; and TNG456, a brain-penetrant PRMT5 inhibitor for the treatment of glioblastoma. It is developing TNG260, a co-repressor of repressor element-1 silencing transcription inhibitor to reverse the immune evasion effect of serine-threonine kinase (STK) 11 loss-of-function mutations to treat lung cancer. The company was founded in 2017 and is headquartered in Boston, Massachusetts.","business_summary_ko":"정밀 종양학 회사인 Tango Therapeutics, Inc.는 의학적 요구가 충족되지 않은 정의된 환자 집단을 대상으로 약품을 발견하고 개발하는 데 중점을 두고 있습니다. 이 회사는 췌장암 및 폐암 치료를 위한 1/2상 임상 시험 중인 TNG462를 포함하여 메틸티오아데노신-협력 단백질 아르기닌 메틸트랜스퍼라제 5(PRMT5) 억제제를 개발합니다. 및 교모세포종 치료를 위한 뇌 침투 PRMT5 억제제인 ​​TNG456. 폐암 치료를 위해 세린-트레오닌 키나제(STK) 11 기능 상실 돌연변이의 면역 회피 효과를 역전시키기 위해 억제 요소-1 침묵 전사 억제제의 공동억제제인 TNG260을 개발하고 있습니다. 이 회사는 2017년에 설립되었으며 매사추세츠주 보스턴에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","desc_ko":"","estimates":[{"period":"2026","rev":0.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":0.0,"rev_g":-1.0,"n":12,"eps":-1.395,"eps_lo":-1.57,"eps_hi":-1.17,"eps_g":-0.6034},{"period":"2027","rev":2616670.0,"rev_lo":0.0,"rev_hi":31400000.0,"rev_g":0.0,"n":12,"eps":-1.68545,"eps_lo":-2.23,"eps_hi":-1.24,"eps_g":-0.2082}],"ltg":null,"calendar":{},"industry_ko":"바이오","financials":[{"period":"2022","revenue":24860000.0,